{"product_id":"read-it-yourself-with-ladybird-level-2-collection-copy","title":"Read It Yourself with Ladybird – Level 4 Collection(7 Books)","description":"\u003cp data-start=\"207\" data-end=\"306\"\u003eReading becomes a full adventure with longer stories, richer vocabulary, and more detailed plots.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"308\" data-end=\"632\"\u003eRead It Yourself with Ladybird – Level 4 is designed for children aged 7–9 who are ready for more complex stories and independent reading challenges. These books feature longer paragraphs, new words, and stories that include dialogue, suspense, and humor, all supported by vivid illustrations that bring each tale to life.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"634\" data-end=\"972\"\u003eWhether it’s a magical adventure, a daring quest, or a hilarious mishap, each book encourages children to read with confidence, build comprehension skills, and enjoy the thrill of finishing a full story on their own. Perfect for bedtime, school reading, or quiet weekend reading, Level 4 makes reading an exciting experience every time.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"634\" data-end=\"972\"\u003eTITLES - \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"1000\" data-end=\"1237\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1000\" data-end=\"1034\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1002\" data-end=\"1034\"\u003eHarry and the Dinosaurs United\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1035\" data-end=\"1080\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1037\" data-end=\"1080\"\u003eMoshi Monsters: Katsuma and the Art Thief\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1081\" data-end=\"1110\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1083\" data-end=\"1110\"\u003eThe Pied Piper of Hamelin\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1111\" data-end=\"1146\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1113\" data-end=\"1146\"\u003eSnow White and the Seven Dwarfs\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1147\" data-end=\"1167\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\